# MathViz V2 Testing Checklist
- [ ] Open http://localhost:5173/
- [ ] Capture landing page screenshot
- [ ] Test "Row Reduction (RREF)"
    - [ ] Click "Row Reduction (RREF)"
    - [ ] Wait 2s and capture screenshot
    - [ ] Scroll down and capture middle/lower steps screenshot
- [ ] Return to home (click "MathViz")
- [ ] Test "Quadratic Formula"
    - [ ] Click "Quadratic Formula"
    - [ ] Wait 2s and capture screenshot
    - [ ] Scroll to graph and capture screenshot
- [ ] Final report on visual appearance and issues
